WEBVTT

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.410
Thank you for bringing me home.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:48.870
I'll call you again soon.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.430
What's all this?

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:06.180
You can't be serious.

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:55.070
O-Okay, I'm going to read it then.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.530
She's in Fukuoka right now.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:40.220
Fukuoka?  What is she doing there?

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:47.030
She said she can't come home yet.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:57.230
Maybe I should go find her.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.960
What was that sound?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.250
You don't need to find her?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:06.920
What are you going to do when you find her?

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:10.100
You're going to convince her to come back and give Yuzuyu-chan back to her?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.440
We can't do such a dangerous thing.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:21.500
It won't mean anything if she doesn't come back to Yuzuyu-chan out of her own will as a mother.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.990
If there's not enough money here I will pay.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.810
Kippei will keep taking care of her.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:37.960
Right?

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:43.210
Yes.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:44.570
We're done.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.110
Nee-chan's scary.

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.240
Kippei...

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.360
there's a letter for Yuzuyu-chan too.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:09.020
I don't know if we should give it to her...

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:13.850
What do you think?

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:22.660
I'm going to take it for now.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.120
Good afternoon, Rabbit-san.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.270
Good afternoon, Bear-san.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:54.870
I'm going to the local fish market.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.680
I'm going!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.480
Yuzuyu!

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.490
What?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.870
This is a letter from your mother.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:22.690
Mama?

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:24.980
Yes.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.760
Toe Yuzuyu.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.780
It's pronounced as "to".

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:39.540
"To"?

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.140
You're done reading it already?

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:07.910
Yes.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.260
Did you read it all?

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.290
It was all in hiragana so...

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:14.680
I'm putting it away.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.050
I have to use the bathroom.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.070
Wait, what is it?

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.890
What did it say?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.290
Isn't there something?

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.400
Aren't you going to let me know?!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:44.250
It bothers me.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:58.200
Okay, I, President Motoki, will now do the seat changes.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:00.520
You're not really the president.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.680
Quickly get up and pick a raffle ticket.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:12.310
I'm in the very back.  I can't see the board.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:14.200
You should be happy!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.720
I have to sit behind Kameda.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.290
I'm number three.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.730
Hey, Kippei, wake up.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.250
You're in the way.

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.480
What is everyone doing?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.440
Seat changes?

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.210
Number eleven?

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:38.810
You're my neighbor, Kokoro-chan!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.630
Are you serious?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.460
Will you all hurry up and settle down?!

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.630
I'm going to start the lesson.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.390
Hey, Kokoro-chan?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.380
Can I share your textbook with you?  I forgot mine.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:00.230
You forgot your textbook?  Are you really serious about learning?

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.040
Are you serious, Kokoro-chan?

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:03.520
I am.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.600
Yamano! Answer it.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:16.380
Okay. Let's see...

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.810
Hey, Kokoro-chan, are you free?

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:26.410
You're free aren't you?

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.190
Is Ponzu doing well?

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:37.860
P-Ponzu?  Are you talking about Yuzuyu-chan?

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:39.200
Oh yeah, her.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.620
I think that's completely different.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:45.910
She's adorable!  Because I'm raising her.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.640
Of course she's cute!

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.830
You should play with her a lot.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.640
Tomorrow is a day off, so how about the three of us play together?

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.370
Maybe at the sandbox.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:02.380
I won't play.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:10.310
Recently when I look at Kokoro-chin my heart starts pounding.

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:14.090
Katakura!  Stop daydreaming and answer the next problem.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:18.950
Sensei, I don't understand what I don't understand.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:20.630
I'm done with you.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:23.380
You're so mean, Sensei!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.490
Be quiet!

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:28.350
Pay attention to me!

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.920
Hey, Sensei!

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:40.110
Yuzuyu!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:43.170
I'm going to take you to the park today.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.740
I'm going to play with Ken-kun and Marika-chan today!

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:55.010
Then, I'll be careful and I'm leaving now!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:57.880
Be careful.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.580
Yuzuyu-chan's going out?

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:04.330
What am I going to do?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.440
She went all by herself!

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.790
I'm lonely!  I'm so very lonely!

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.950
Why don't you just go out too?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.410
And, on top of that, she's going to go play with a boy.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:16.120
I can't believe it!

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:19.380
What are you glaring at?

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:20.990
Yu-Yu-

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.340
Yuzuyu...

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:48.380
I'm going to destroy you!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.590
Bang!

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:57.280
Today, I'm going to go play tennis with my boyfriend!

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:01.460
I won't lose!

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:10.170
After tennis, which restaurant should we go to?

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:27.420
It seems like you don't quite understand how to play.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:36.480
Ken-kun is a boy, so if his interests are different from mine, that can't be helped, but...

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:41.460
Yuzuyu-chan, why are you playing with a bear?

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.890
When you grow up you can't have a conversation talking about,

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:53.560
"Are you more for Jenny-chan or Riko-chan?" and get all excited over the topic.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:54.810
B-Bear...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.720
It's cute, you know?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.390
I got it from my Mama.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.290
So?

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:09.730
Everyone!

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:11.220
Mama!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:14.830
It's snack time.  Let's all go downstairs.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.090
Yay!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:18.720
Don't fall down the stairs.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.810
Thank you for the food, Obaa-sama.

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.530
Marika-chan, go on ahead.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.290
Yuzuyu-chan, you too.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.900
Here, Yuzuyu.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.800
It's a present from Mama!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:43.700
Yay! Bear-san!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:50.310
Okay Bear-san, it's time for your meal.  Eat up.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.440
Yuzuyu, you can't feed it.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.760
But I want to feed it!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.190
Stuffed animals don't have to eat.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:01.200
He's going to eat!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.460
No, he's not!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.820
He's going to!

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.670
Here you go, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:28.590
Thank you for the food.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.500
It's delicious!

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.430
I have more for seconds.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.760
Yes!

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:09.840
Yuzuyu...

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:12.290
I'm home.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:20.340
What's wrong?

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.310
Bear-san is going to eat carrots.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:31.180
Yuzuyu, I told you that Bear-san can't eat.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.620
He's going to eat.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:41.590
You got it so dirty and it was so expensive...

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.980
Yuzuyu, Mama's a cry baby, so...

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:07.030
Papa made you feel all better, right?

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:10.430
Now you have to cheer Mama up.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.040
Mama.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.070
Mama, I'm sorry.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:43.670
I love you, Mama.

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.330
I'm sorry too.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:54.130
I love you too, Yuzuyu.

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:26.500
Obaa-sama, your cake for snack was so good, please make it for us again!

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:27.850
Alright, Marika-chan.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.120
Bye!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.280
See you again.

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:32.160
You two be careful.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:20.060
To Yuzuyu:

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.010
Are you doing well?

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.970
Are you properly eating?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.240
Are you crying at all?

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.130
I'm sorry.

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:35.120
Mama is such a cry baby.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:39.060
When Mama gets strong,

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.070
can I come get you?

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:43.880
Is that okay?

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.610
Will you wait for me?

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.930
I'm sorry, Yuzuyu.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:56.150
Mama loves Yuzuyu very much.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:01.310
Mama...

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:09.090
Hurry and come home!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:20.000
If you don't, I might forget your face.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.740
Hurry and come home.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:41.250
Since I've been taking care of Yuzuyu lately...

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.440
I'm so bored when she's not here.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.180
I'm starting to want to get a girlfriend.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.830
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.380
What? You're back already?

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:01.560
I'm home!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:06.600
What is it?  Sometimes you get so clingy and then you push me away.

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.260
I'm just kidding.  Did you have fun?

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:10.760
Yep!

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.320
Okay then, let's go home.

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:15.800
Piggyback!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:22.820
Tomorrow, I want hotcakes.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:24.790
Hotcakes?

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:25.610
Yeah!

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.680
What are hotcakes made out of?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.470
Hotcakes are hotcakes.

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:34.540
I see.  All right...

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:37.340
but I wonder if we have any at home.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.170
I'm sure we do.

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.290
Yep, of course we do.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.370
Yep, yep!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.720
What are you looking at?

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:00.550
Stop it.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.310
I think that if you were my girlfriend, that would be nice.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:06.390
You're cute when you smile, and...

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:12.280
Want to go out?

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:13.050
Want to go-

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.020
Kokoro would be wasted on you!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.590
Kippei!  Don't try to seduce Kokoro.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.070
OK!  Get in your seats!

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.620
I'm going to start the lesson.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:33.480
Kokoro-chin...

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:39.620
Sensei, my parents are calling for me so I'm going home.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.880
Is there something at Kokoro-chin's house today?

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:48.200
It seems her dad is getting remarried.

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:51.090
Kokoro is going to have to live on her own.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:53.530
It's really complicated right now.

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:55.430
What about her mom?

00:21:55.850 --> 00:24:11.440
Kokoro doesn't have a mother.

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.800
Yuzuyu!  We're going shopping.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:21.720
Okay!

00:24:22.040 --> 00:24:23.840
I'll get you an ice cream with the change.

00:24:23.990 --> 00:24:26.520
Yay!  I love ice cream!

00:24:27.610 --> 00:24:28.350
Onee-chan!

00:24:29.570 --> 00:24:31.760
Kokoro-chan, are you moving?

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:36.250
What?! You're going to live all by yourself in this condo?!

00:24:36.410 --> 00:24:39.150
Wow!  It's really high!

00:24:40.420 --> 00:24:42.170
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:42.930 --> 00:24:44.330
Kokoro All Alone

00:24:45.190 --> 00:24:47.320
Aren't you lonely, Onee-chan?
